sequenceDiagram
  %% command: instance:deploy
  %% kind: instance.deploy
  %% status: migrated
  autonumber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant SW as Swamp
  participant N as Owning AppProd Node
  CLI->>GW: instance:deploy and optional pinned commit
  GW->>GW: Hold this Instance and record the admitted commit
  Note over GW: First checkout migration pins its serving commit
  GW->>SW: Start production-release with a private vault reference
  SW->>N: Validate Instance, Node, source, live selection and prerequisites
  SW->>N: Wake preparation, deploy, migrate and seal the build
  SW->>N: Clone the finished build and sleep preparation
  SW->>N: Verify candidate and switch the Instance Routes
  SW->>N: Handover workloads, drain and freeze former live
  SW->>N: Read actual live and old identities
  SW-->>GW: Operation, Node, Instance, commit and artifact receipt
  GW-->>CLI: Record verified selection and deployment outcome
